@startuml customer_online_booking_activity
title Activity Diagram: Customer Online Booking

start
:Customer browses Movies & Showtimes;
:Customer selects a Showtime;
:System displays Seat Layout;
:Customer selects Seats;
:Customer selects Combos (Optional);
:System calculates Subtotal;
:Customer applies Promotion/Voucher;
:System verifies Tier & calculates Discount;
:System calculates Final Total;
:Customer proceeds to Checkout;
:System generates Payment Link & redirects;
if (Customer pays within Time Limit?) then (Yes)
  :Payment Gateway notifies System (Webhook);
  :System updates Booking Status to PAID;
  :System generates E-Ticket (QR Code);
  :System sends Email to Customer;
  :System updates Customer Reward Points;
else (No/Timeout)
  :System cancels Pending Booking;
  :System releases Seats;
  :System notifies Customer of Timeout;
endif
stop
@enduml